<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<%- include('partials/html-head'); -%>
	<body>
		<div id="app" class="wrap prose" v-cloak>
			<%- include('partials/header', { heading: 'Privacy policy' }); -%>

			<section>
				<p>
					Your privacy matters to us. This Privacy Policy outlines how Pushie collects, uses, and protects your personal
					information when you use our services.
				</p>

				<h3>Information We Collect</h3>
				<p>We collect the following information:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Account Information:</strong> When you create an account to publish, we collect your username, email
						address, and password.
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Usage Data:</strong> We log information such as the channels you subscribe to, the pushes you
						publish, and basic usage patterns (e.g., timestamps).
					</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Device Information:</strong> We may also collect data like browser type, operating system, and IP
						address to help us understand usage trends and ensure service reliability.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
				<p>We use your information to:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Operate and maintain Pushie,</li>
					<li>Send your pushes to subscribers via browser push notifications,</li>
					<li>Prevent abuse (e.g., rate limiting per IP/account),</li>
					<li>Improve the reliability and performance of the service,</li>
					<li>Respond to support requests or questions you send us.</li>
				</ul>

				<h3>Push Content and Retention</h3>
				<p>
					Pushes (your public messages) are stored temporarily and automatically deleted after
					<strong>24 hours</strong>. We do not retain or archive pushes beyond this window. Subscribers only receive
					messages in real time or during this 24-hour window.
				</p>

				<h3>Sharing Your Information</h3>
				<p>We do not sell your data. We don’t share your personal information unless:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>We’re required by law or legal process,</li>
					<li>It's necessary to protect Pushie, its users, or the public from harm or abuse.</li>
				</ul>

				<h3>Security</h3>
				<p>
					We use reasonable technical measures to safeguard your data. However, no system is completely secure. Please
					use a strong password and do not reuse passwords across services.
				</p>

				<h3>Your Rights</h3>
				<p>
					You may contact us at any time to request that we delete your account and associated data. We will process
					such requests promptly.
				</p>

				<h3>Cookies</h3>
				<p>
					Pushie may use cookies or local storage to remember your login or preferences. You can clear these through
					your browser settings. Disabling cookies may limit your ability to stay logged in or use push notifications.
				</p>

				<h3>Third-Party Links</h3>
				<p>
					Some pushes may contain links to external websites. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for
					their content or privacy practices.
				</p>

				<h3>Changes to This Policy</h3>
				<p>
					We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the date at the top of this
					document. Please check back occasionally for the latest version.
				</p>

				<h3>Contact Us</h3>
				<p>
					If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, reach out to us at
					<a href="mailto:hello@pushie.net">hello@pushie.net</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
		<%- include('partials/footer'); -%>
	</body>
</html>
